@api = https://localhost:7107
@identityServer = https://localhost:5001

### 1. Get an access token (client credentials) - copy "access_token" from the response into @token below
POST {{identityServer}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=quipu.client&client_secret=quipu-secret&scope=book.api

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Get all books
GET {{api}}/api/book
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a book
GET {{api}}/api/book/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a book
POST {{api}}/api/book
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Idiot",
  "subTitle": null,
  "authorId": 1
}

### Update a book
PUT {{api}}/api/book/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Crime and Punishment",
  "subTitle": "Updated subtitle",
  "authorId": 1
}

### Delete a book
DELETE {{api}}/api/book/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search requires a user token (implicit flow) - use Swagger's "Authorize" (implicit) to get one
